  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> </span> </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">will shortly announce the Result for the Various Group D Posts in Level 1 after evaluating their Performance in CBT I Exam. This recruitment was released for 32,438 posts. Applications for the Railway RRB Group D Recruitment 2025 were accepted from 23 January 2025, to 01 March 2025. The CBT examination was held on 27 November 2025 to 16 January 2026. Candidates need to maintain a frequent check on the  Portal for getting information regarding Railway RRB Group D Result 2026, It will be uploaded shortly.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Railway Recruitment Boards (RRBs)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">RRB Group D Result 2026 </span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">RRB Group D Advt.No: 08/2024</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : <strong>22 January 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>23 January 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>01 March 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>03 March 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Date : <strong>04-13 March 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date : <strong>27 November 2025 to 16 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Revised Exam Date : <strong>08, 09 January 2026 and 02, 03, 04, 05, 06, 09 &amp; 10 February 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam City Details : <strong>19 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>24 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key : <strong>17 February 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Window : <strong>17-23 June 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Result : <strong>Notify Here Soon</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, OBC, EWS : <strong>Rs. 500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH : <strong>Rs. 250/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All Category Female :<strong>&nbsp;Rs. 250/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Fee Refund (After Appearing in Stage I Exam)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 400/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">OBC, EWS, SC, ST, PH : <strong>Rs. 250/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All Category Female :<strong>&nbsp;Rs. 250/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RRB Group D Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 July 2025</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>36 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per RRB Group D Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Railway RRB Group D 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 32,438 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.3079%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 13.7821%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>General&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 13.0947%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>EWS</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.7825%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>OBC</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.4365%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>SC</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.5965%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>ST</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.3079%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Various Group D Posts in Level 1</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 13.7821%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">13957</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 13.0947%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">3101</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.7825%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">8153</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.4365%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">4699</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.5965%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">2474</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>RRB Group D Application Form 2025 : Post Wise Vacancy Details</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\">&nbsp;Check RRB Wise Vacancy Details – <a href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/RRB-Wise-Vacancy-Details.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a>&nbsp;</span></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Pointsman-B</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">5058</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant (Track Machine)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">799</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant (Bridge)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">301</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Track Maintainer Gr. IV</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">13187</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant P-Way</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">247</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant (C&amp;W)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">2587</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant TRD</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1381</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant (S&amp;T)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">2012</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Loco Shed (Diesel)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">420</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Loco Shed (Electrical)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">950</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Operations (Electrical)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">744</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant TL &amp; AC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1041</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant TL &amp; AC (Workshop)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">624</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant (Workshop) (Mech)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">3077</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>32438</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>RRB Group D Bharti 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed their Matriculation (Class 10<sup>th</sup>/High School) Level of Examination from any recognized board along with having ITI Certification in relevant trade from NCVT / SCVT approved institution OR NAC Certification holders will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Railway RRB Group D Job 2025 : Physical Eligibility</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Male&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Female</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Should be able to lift and carry 35 kg of weight for a distance of <strong>100 meters in 02 minutes</strong> in one chance without putting the weight down.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Should be able to run <strong>1000 meters in 04 minutes 15 seconds</strong> in one chance.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Should be able to lift and carry <strong>20 kg of weight</strong> for a distance of <strong>100 meters in 02 minutes</strong> in one chance without putting the weight down.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Should be able to run <strong>1000 meters in 05 minutes 40</strong> seconds in one chance.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download RRB Group D Result 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must go to the&nbsp;<strong>Important Links</strong>&nbsp;section below</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then the candidates must click on the&nbsp;<strong>Download Result</strong>&nbsp;link.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After clicking on the link, the candidates will be redirected to a new page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In this page, candidates have to enter the following details:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Registration no.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Login ID</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Birth Date/Password</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Captcha Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then the candidates have to&nbsp; submit the details by clicking on the Login button.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After successful login, candidates will be able to download the Result.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Alternatively, the candidates can download the RRB Group D Result from the official website of RRB also.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RRB Group D Recruitment 2025 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Computer-Based Test (CBT)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Physical Efficiency Test (PET)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification (DV)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; height: 2682px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 22px;\">\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px; height: 22px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px; height: 22px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22px;\">\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 22px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 22px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 54px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0px; height: 54px;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 103px;\">\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px; height: 103px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Register For Result</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"height: 103px;