ass=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Railway Recruitment Board</span></span></strong>.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\"><strong>Q. What is the next step after qualifying the exam?<br></strong><strong>Answer. </strong>Qualified candidates will be called for <strong data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"676\">Physical Efficiency Test (PET)</strong>, document verification, and medical test.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\"><strong>Q. What is RRB Official Website?<br></strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The Official Website of RRB is https://indianrailways.gov.in/</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
